\section{Tổng Quan Thiết Kế \& Đặc Tả Cổng Giao Tiếp (Port Specification)}
Full-duplex 8N1 UART transceiver with parameterized CLK\_FREQ and BAUD\_RATE, 16x mid-bit oversampling receiver, stop-bit framing-error detector with safe line-idle recovery, and dual 8-byte circular show-ahead synchronous TX/RX FIFOs with full/empty write/read guards targeting Terasic DE1-SoC (Cyclone V).

